`QuerySet.get` returns (e.g. wrapping the model instance it returns
in a lazy proxy) in django/db/models/query.py.

Identify every real caller in the provided context that actually
binds or unpacks `.get(...)`'s return value (a plain
`x = qs.get(...)` assignment, or a caller of such a caller two hops
out) - callers that only call `.get(...)` for a side effect without
binding the result do not count.

Name every affected symbol by its exact fully-qualified name as given
in the context, in prose.


## Response format

